     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div>Hi all,</div><div><br></div><div>I submitted workflowr 1.6.2 to CRAN today. It  includes minor improvements, updated documentation, and bug fixes.<br></div><div><br></div><div><a href=\"https://github.com/jdblischak/workflowr/releases/tag/v1.6.2\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://github.com/jdblischak/workflowr/releases/tag/v1.6.2&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793246910135000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3vTrvA_z4hW866BYtohJIi\">https://github.com/jdblischak/workflowr/releases/tag/v1.6.2</a></div><div><br></div><div>Many thanks to the contributors that helped with this latest release: James Lamb, Anh Tran, Sydney Purdue, and Jim Hester<br></div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><b>Release notes:</b></div><div><br></div><div><div>\r\n    <p>This patch release of workflowr includes minor improvements, \r\nupdated documentation, and bug fixes. Users are encouraged to upgrade \r\nworkflowr so that it is compatible with the next release of <a href=\"https://github.com/r-lib/fs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://github.com/r-lib/fs&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793246910135000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2AOa4td_zB1bpqf5kwcpJH\">fs</a> (&gt;1.4.1).</p><p><br></p>\r\n<h2>Minor improvements</h2>\r\n<ul><li>Make the HTTP calls by <code>wflow_use_github()</code> to the GitHub API more resilient to transient network issues by automatically retrying HTTP calls more than once (<a href=\"https://github.com/jameslamb\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://github.com/jameslamb&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793246910135000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2d3qb1XCAj9J5koekm2lI2\">@jameslamb</a>, <a href=\"https://github.com/jdblischak/workflowr/pull/199\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://github.com/jdblischak/workflowr/pull/199&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793246910135000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3JjRVZqJjTraCS_ZG0mOHM\">#199</a>, <a href=\"https://github.com/jdblischak/workflowr/pull/201\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://github.com/jdblischak/workflowr/pull/201&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793246910135000&amp;usg=AOvVaw32tUcPxnnkHeWM_NZFiyPZ\">#201</a>)</li><li>Enhance the RStudio Project Template to include more arguments from <code>wflow_start()</code> (<a href=\"https://github.com/trannhatanh89\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://github.com/trannhatanh89&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793246910135000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3r2F543xUfSmxL5W6u7WP1\">@trannhatanh89</a>, <a href=\"https://github.com/jdblischak/workflowr/issues/193\" aria-label=\"#193, Wrapper function to enhance RStudio Project Template\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://github.com/jdblischak/workflowr/issues/193&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793246910135000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1WKihQpszd6i5Eh1rKCMsF\">#193</a>, <a href=\"https://github.com/jdblischak/workflowr/pull/200\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://github.com/jdblischak/workflowr/pull/200&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793246910135000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2VY16PnaY0PSK3iJamV08F\">#200</a>)</li><li>Throw error early if user sets <code>overwrite = TRUE</code> to <code>wflow_start()</code> but <code>existing = FALSE</code>, since it isn&#39;t possible to overwrite non-existent files (<a href=\"https://github.com/skpurdue\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://github.com/skpurdue&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793246910135000&amp;usg=AOvVaw35tfEvhh95E2oQDPAYmbGN\">@skpurdue</a>, <a href=\"https://github.com/jdblischak/workflowr/issues/194\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://github.com/jdblischak/workflowr/issues/194&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793246910135000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2UACYm7alojmpdllcrIsXm\">#194</a>, <a href=\"https://github.com/jdblischak/workflowr/pull/202\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://github.com/jdblischak/workflowr/pull/202&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793246910135000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1maZsZmJLA3UumrRv3uMjf\">#202</a>, idea from <a href=\"https://github.com/pcarbo\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://github.com/pcarbo&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793246910135000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0lzCWvGtADlDX1L5QuZdIO\">@pcarbo</a>)</li></ul>\r\n<h2>Updated documentation</h2>\r\n<ul><li>Update FAQ entry on external images to note that the website directory for GitLab Pages is <code>public/</code>, not <code>docs/</code> (idea from <a href=\"https://github.com/ryurko\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://github.com/ryurko&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793246910135000&amp;usg=AOvVaw00vsrNHjz230QETeeurUps\">@ryurko</a>)</li></ul>\r\n<h2>Bug fixes</h2>\r\n<ul><li>Send warning if Python plots created using outdated version of reticulate (&lt;1.15) (bug report from <a href=\"https://github.com/lazappi\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://github.com/lazappi&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793246910135000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2RL1-xjFYXQ8ZUt9I_M1V5\">@lazappi</a>, <a href=\"https://github.com/jdblischak/workflowr/issues/181\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://github.com/jdblischak/workflowr/issues/181&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793246910135000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1aoVidy0iAlk5TsdEWbAFs\">#181</a>)</li><li>Make workflowr compatible with fs version 1.4.1.9000+ (<a href=\"https://github.com/jimhester\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://github.com/jimhester&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793246910135000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0k4enQVerTWnIETCQOiAso\">@jimhester</a>, <a href=\"https://github.com/jdblischak/workflowr/pull/204\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://github.com/jdblischak/workflowr/pull/204&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793246910135000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0a-2aCPd-Vpb6Kk80Oquha\">#204</a>)</li><li>Set minimum version requirement for dependency rprojroot to 1.2</li><li>Skip test of error handling of deleted working directory on Solaris</li></ul>\r\n  </div></div></div>"
